e>Pinheiro</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Oliveira</surname> <given-names>C</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lopes</surname> <given-names>ML</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Suspected Brazilian purpuric fever, Brazilian Amazon Region.</article-title><source>Emerg Infect Dis</source> <year>2009</year>;<volume>15</volume>:<fpage>675</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>6</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3201/eid1504.090014</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19331772</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>